# Olduum's draws, with no GM pin: a level 75 Warrior in Aydeewa Subterrane with six Pickaxes, Olduum accepted at Prog 2
# (GMs). Each Pickaxe to an Excavation Site draws randomInt(1, 100) <= 50 from the world's seeded RNG; a GM takes any
# cell after each finish so the next trade is taken. The seed draws: a success (Prog 1, the Electrocell), a success
# (Prog 2, the Electropot), a failure (mineFail 1: 0 ([1] = 1); finished: mineFail cleared, no cell, Prog 2 kept), a
# success after it (mineFail 0 again: the Electropot), then two failures.
lists AydeewaSubterrane/Excavation_Site/onTrade AydeewaSubterrane/onEventFinish/0
char zone=AydeewaSubterrane pos=392,0.984,349.642 job=WAR lvl=75
item Pickaxe x6
quest AhtUrhgan.Olduum accepted
charvar Quest[6][2]Prog 2
login
trade Excavation_Site Pickaxe x1        # a success: Prog 1, 0 ([0] = Electrocell)
finish                                  # the Electrocell; the pickaxe taken
delkeyitem Electrocell                  # a GM (each cell, held or not)
delkeyitem Electropot
delkeyitem Electrolocomotive
trade Excavation_Site Pickaxe x1        # a success: Prog 2, 0 ([0] = Electropot)
finish                                  # the Electropot; the pickaxe taken
delkeyitem Electrocell                  # a GM (each cell, held or not)
delkeyitem Electropot
delkeyitem Electrolocomotive
trade Excavation_Site Pickaxe x1        # a failure: mineFail 1, 0 ([1] = 1)
finish                                  # mineFail: cleared; no cell; the pickaxe taken
delkeyitem Electrocell                  # a GM (each cell, held or not)
delkeyitem Electropot
delkeyitem Electrolocomotive
trade Excavation_Site Pickaxe x1        # a success: 0 ([0] = Electropot)
finish                                  # mineFail 0: the Electropot; the pickaxe taken
delkeyitem Electrocell                  # a GM (each cell, held or not)
delkeyitem Electropot
delkeyitem Electrolocomotive
trade Excavation_Site Pickaxe x1        # a failure: 0 ([1] = 1)
finish                                  # mineFail: cleared; the pickaxe taken
delkeyitem Electrocell                  # a GM (each cell, held or not)
delkeyitem Electropot
delkeyitem Electrolocomotive
trade Excavation_Site Pickaxe x1        # a failure: 0 ([1] = 1)
finish                                  # mineFail: cleared; the pickaxe taken
